# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The AI-QEM support team is here to help. If you encounter any issues, have questions about using the AI-QEM Function, or need help troubleshooting a job, contact the support team.\n"
msgstr "Das AI-QEM-Support-Team hilft dir gerne. Wenn du auf Probleme stößt, Fragen zur Verwendung der AI-QEM-Function hast oder Hilfe bei der Fehlersuche in einem Job benötigst, wende dich an das Support-Team.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support: quantumfunction.support@ltm.com\n"
msgstr "Support: quantumfunction.support@ltm.com\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To help the support team investigate and resolve your issue as quickly as possible, include the following information in your support request:\n"
msgstr "Damit das Support-Team dein Problem so schnell wie möglich untersuchen und lösen kann, gib in deiner Support-Anfrage die folgenden Informationen an:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function job ID (for example, `job.job_id`)\n"
msgstr "Function-Job-ID (zum Beispiel `job.job_id`)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A detailed description of the issue\n"
msgstr "Eine detaillierte Beschreibung des Problems\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Any relevant error messages, stack traces, or error codes\n"
msgstr "Relevante Fehlermeldungen, Stack-Traces oder Fehlercodes\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expected behavior and actual behavior (if applicable)\n"
msgstr "Erwartetes Verhalten und tatsächliches Verhalten (falls zutreffend)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complete information helps the support team diagnose issues more efficiently and resolve them faster.\n"
msgstr "Vollständige Informationen helfen dem Support-Team, Probleme effizienter zu diagnostizieren und schneller zu lösen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The AI-QEM support team also welcomes feedback and feature requests. If you have suggestions for improvements or capabilities that you want to see in future releases, send them to quantumfunction.support@ltm.com.\n"
msgstr "Das AI-QEM-Support-Team freut sich auch über Feedback und Funktionswünsche. Wenn du Verbesserungsvorschläge hast oder dir Fähigkeiten für zukünftige Versionen wünschst, sende sie an quantumfunction.support@ltm.com.\n"

